WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Before the light reaches the water, Mukamana is already at the shore.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Her hands know the work better than she does. Knot, pull, loop, knot.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Mukamana: My husband taught me the first knot. I have been tying it ever since.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Fifty-one years of mornings. The nets are never finished, only mended.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[Water laps against the hull. A rooster calls somewhere up the hill.]

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Mukamana: When the lake is calm, I think he is still out there, waiting for me to finish.
